   "author_id": 7765,
   "author_url": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/user/7765/alex",
   "created_at": "2023-10-14T19:50:13+00:00",
   "body_html": "<!--[if BLOCK]><![endif]-->            <p>Notice the folder is named \u201czzz-remove-ergo-penalty\u201d.</p>\n<p>Server mods load alphabetically.</p>\n<p>If the modded weapon mod has a name something like \u201czzzzz-MCX-Spear\u201d, it wouldn\u2019t work. If it has a normal name like \u201cHK-53 mod\u201d or \u201cM-LOK foregrip\u201d, ergo penalty would be removed, as my mod is loaded after.</p>\n\n        <!--[if ENDBLOCK]><![endif]-->",
   "likes": 0
  },
